pkg:Evidence_v1_34_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.34.0 (real conformance-Goal architecture, fillsScope)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: read a directly relevant pending handover before continuing, which exposed a genuine modeling gap -- STORY-16 (this lineage's own real BRSF-conformance work) had been pointed at a product-facing objective, exactly the dishonest fit the handover's own finding names. Built the honest fix: a real Goal and Objective whose metric is the actual SHACL violation count against the current standard, re-verified fresh each time. Building this required recomputing Stage_Goal/Stage_Objective's digests for the first time this session, which caught a real formula error in this session's own prior digest work (non-cumulative rather than the tool's real cumulative formula) -- never surfaced before since neither stage had needed recomputing since first closing. Got the tool's own authoritative digest directly and corrected all 3 affected StageOutputs. Applied fillsScope to all 8 eligible objectives, honest given this lineage's real scope-first construction order. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS, 127 -> 121 violations, a real reduction."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "fe52ea84d7af06451a7d9c1b4a5f6ec74f6bf378c4f4549c7f648d47540d092c"^^xsd:string .
